    "biography": {
      "concept": "Valkyrie captain of the Valhaulans, the sideways-landing sky pirates (Act 5)",
      "notes": "Sklar Bjrornholt leads the Valhaulans, aerial techno-Viking pirates who rob you, apologise, and sell your goods back, and whose airships always land sideways. She is a towering, charismatic Valkyrie with impeccable leadership and no impulse control. She offers you a drink before she decides what you are, and decides while you drink it. She is mercenary and honest about it, delighted by boldness, bored by caution, and laughs at the wrong moments and means it. 'I like you already.'"
    }
